SUMMARY:Escape Room Time - North Jersey
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\nIt is esc
 ape room time.\n\nThe event comes to you courtesy of our WhatsApp group ch
 at.\n\nJoin us at 7:20 p.m.\, 7:40 p.m. or 7:50 p.m. on Friday\, July 31 a
 t Amazing Escape Room\, 281 Liberty St. in Bloomfield.\n\nThe cost per per
 son is $33 per person. PLEASE PAY IN ADVANCE. Details are below.\n\nTechni
 cally\, a room can only accommodate up to 10\, 11 or 12 people. No food or
  drinks are allowed on site. There is street parking.\n\n\\*\\*\\* There i
 s a good chance we'll hang out some more at a diner or bar afterward. Feel
  free to make suggestions!! \\*\\*\\*\n\nThese are the groups thus far! If
  you want to be added\, subtracted\, or moved\, just let me know. We're fl
 exible!\n\nGroup #1 (Last Night in Vegas @ 7:20 p.m.) - Kyle M (PAID)\, Sh
 raddha (PAID)\, Sasmit (PAID)\, Christy S. (PAID)\, Cody K (PAID)\, Kulwin
 der\, Hardik\, Kewal\, Uday\n\nGroup #2 (Lost in Space @ 7:40 p.m.) - Chlo
 e P (PAID)\, Leena (PAID)\, Leena's Guest #1 (PAID/Rahul)\, Leena's Guest 
 #2 (PAID/Jui-Chin)\, Leena's Guest #3 (PAID/Yun-Ya)\, Cedric B (PAID)\, Ra
 y\, Jeffrey G\, Osvaldo\n\nGroup #3 (Shipwreck @ 7:50 p.m.) Andy M (PAID)\
 , Satish (PAID)\, Fran (PAID)\, Wola O (PAID)\, Wola's Guest (PAID)\, Andr
 ea R (PAID)\, Robert K (PAID)\, Robert's Guest (PAID)\, Warus\n\nPAYMENT I
 NFO: I've got Venmo\, Zelle\, PayPal and Cash App. Try to locate my accoun
 t with my email first. [andymilone@verizon.net](mailto:andymilone@verizon.
 net) Or it may show up under my name Andy Milone or Andrew Milone. Or try 
 201-406-7222. You can try my other number\, 201-234-9609\, BUT PLEASE DON'
 T USE IT FOR VENMO! That is no longer my account. Thank you everyone!!! Fe
 el free to reach out with any questions!!\n\nMore info: https://amazingesc
 aperoom.com/all-rooms/\n\nQuestions or comments? You can message Andy on M
 eetup\, or call/text him at 201-234-9609.\n\nThis is our first escape room
  trip. Feel free to also check out bowling\, soccer\, volleyball\, tennis 
 or one of our other activities at: www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soc
 cer-volleyball.
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/north-jersey-bowling-soccer-volleybal
 l/events/315349542/
