SUMMARY:Board Game Night - Paris Baguette
DESCRIPTION:North Jersey Bowling\, Volleyball\, Tennis And More\n**Join us
  for a board game event! Please bring your favorite board games to the eve
 nt! We can play games like chess\, parcheesi\, etc**\n\n**We will be meeti
 ng at Paris Baguette in Paramus\, NJ!**\n\n**Paris Baguette has pastries\,
  bakery items\, and coffee.**\n\n**If you are not feeling well\, please do
  not attend our event.Thank you!**\n\n**NOTE: If you are not attending the
  event\, please change your RSVP accordingly.**
